          "text": "Sitar Tandoori is at 43 High Street, Cherry Hinton. The postcode is CB1 9HX, and the phone number is 01223 249955."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "What type of food does the restaurant serve?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "It serves Indian food."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Thank you. Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You're welcome. Goodbye."
